       "3x^2-3=0 \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=-1,\\ 1.\n",
       "\\]\n",
       "\n",
       "The corresponding points on \\(y=x^3-3x\\) are:\n",
       "\n",
       "\\[\n",
       "(-1,2)\\quad\\text{and}\\quad(1,-2).\n",
       "\\]\n",
       "\n",
       "The graph above marks these stationary points.</em></div>"
